{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.809999465942383,"text":"A man over two meters tall, arms wide, weight on the front foot, about to throw something. The unsolved question is what? If he held a thunderbolt, he is Zeus. If he held a trident, he is Poseidon. The weapon was never found, so the statue is simply called the Artemesian bronze. It was made around 460 B.C. and was lifted from the sea near Euboea in two pieces.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"man","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.7799999713897705},{"word":"over","start":0.7799999713897705,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"two","start":1.1799999475479126,"end":1.4800000190734863},{"word":"meters","start":1.4800000190734863,"end":1.7999999523162842},{"word":"tall","start":1.7999999523162842,"end":2.299999952316284},{"word":"arms","start":2.859999895095825,"end":2.940000057220459},{"word":"wide","start":2.940000057220459,"end":3.359999895095825},{"word":"weight","start":3.7799999713897705,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"on","start":3.799999952316284,"end":3.9600000381469727},{"word":"the","start":3.9600000381469727,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"front","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.380000114440918},{"word":"foot","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"about","start":5.159999847412109,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"to","start":5.440000057220459,"end":5.860000133514404},{"word":"throw","start":5.860000133514404,"end":5.920000076293945},{"word":"something","start":5.920000076293945,"end":6.400000095367432},{"word":"The","start":6.900000095367432,"end":7.119999885559082},{"word":"unsolved","start":7.119999885559082,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"question","start":7.659999847412109,"end":8.15999984741211},{"word":"is","start":8.15999984741211,"end":8.4399995803833},{"word":"what","start":8.4399995803833,"end":8.800000190734863},{"word":"If","start":9.239999771118164,"end":9.359999656677246},{"word":"he","start":9.359999656677